{"id":5200,"date":"2024-12-06T22:23:51","date_gmt":"2024-12-06T14:23:51","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=5200"},"modified":"2024-12-06T22:23:51","modified_gmt":"2024-12-06T14:23:51","slug":"filter-bags-for-asphalt-mixing-plants","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=filter-bags-for-asphalt-mixing-plants","title":{"rendered":"Filter Bags for Asphalt Mixing Plants"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Filter media in asphalt mixing plants are exposed to extreme environmental conditions and aggressive corrosive gases. Frequent temperature fluctuations and business creation and stops with different fuels and the resulting potential sparks put additional pressure on the filter media.<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5201\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/1-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"808\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/1-detail1.jpg 960w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/1-detail1-300x253.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/1-detail1-768x646.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/1-detail1-600x505.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Asphalt concrete mixing equipment have a first dust filter and secondary filter. Usually with only a small mixing factory need equipment dust; large mixing equipment have two-stage filteration for achieving the environmental dust requirements., As general, the first filtration is gravity or centrifugal dry scrubbers, wet dust is often two or dust bag . After wet dust back up to 400mg \/ m3, bag house dust back up to 50mg \/ m3. Early asphalt mixing plant is configured to filter out dry cyclone dust. Due to the dry cyclone dust can only remove large particles (&gt; 5 \u03bcm) dust, and the dust content of large particles of dust rarely. Massive emissions of less than 5\u03bcm fine dust. With the development of improved environmental requirements and dust removal technology, asphalt mixing equipment to achieve only through secondary dust emissions requirements. The secondary dedusting methods are two kinds of wet dust bag, dust to take a different way according to different requirements. First dust collector There is a cyclone dust collector, dust collector and two kinds of gravity. Cyclone simple structure, which is cylindrical dust collecting means, the air flow tangential entry, the dust is separated by centrifugal force. Cyclones can collect more than 5\u03bcm particle size of the dust collection efficiency is generally 5% to 85%. Gravity dust is reduced by the expansion tank of gas flow rate, by gravity so that large dust particles fall, trapping particles greater than 40\u03bcm in general.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h3>Materials and Performance<\/h3>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\"><strong>Material<\/strong><\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance\"><strong>Temperature<\/strong><br \/>\n<strong>Resistance<\/strong><\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Chemical Resistance\"><strong>Chemical Resistance<\/strong><\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Durability\"><strong>Durability<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Nomex (Aramid)\">Nomex (Aramid)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 200C (392\u00b0F)\">Up to 200\u00b0C (392\u00b0F)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)\">PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 190C (374\u00b0F)\">Up to 190\u00b0C (374\u00b0F)<\/td>